<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Submission Confirmed | Synkro</title>
    <meta name="description"
        content="Thank you for submitting your project brief to Synkro. Your official consultation confirmation and details are ready." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#07080c" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/gggg.jpg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        /* ========== Design tokens ========== */
        :root {
            --bg: #07080c;
            --bg-2: #0b0d13;
            --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            --surface-2: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --border-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
            --text: #eceef3;
            --muted: #8b90a0;
            --dim: #5d6272;
            --accent: #7c6cff;
            --accent-2: #4fd1e8;
            --accent-3: #c26bff;
            --grad: linear-gradient(120deg, #7c6cff 0%, #c26bff 45%, #4fd1e8 100%);
            --radius: 16px;
            --radius-lg: 24px;
            --container: 1180px;
            --ease: cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1);
            --font-head: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
            --font-body: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
        }

        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        img {
            display: block;
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: var(--container);
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        .grad-text {
            background: var(--grad);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        /* ========== Background Decoration ========== */
        .bg-grid {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: -2;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 64px 64px;
            mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, #000 40%, transparent 100%);
            -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, #000 40%, transparent 100%);
        }

        .bg-glow {
            position: fixed;
            width: 550px;
            height: 550px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(120px);
            opacity: 0.18;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .bg-glow.one {
            top: -100px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #28c840 0%, #4fd1e8 70%);
        }

        .bg-glow.two {
            bottom: 10%;
            right: 5%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #7c6cff 0%, #c26bff 70%);
        }

        /* ========== Navigation ========== */
        .nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(7, 8, 12, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            transition: background .3s var(--ease);
        }

        .nav-inner {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            height: 72px;
        }

        .brand {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .brand img {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 32px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            font-size: .95rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color .2s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .nav-cta {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 12px 22px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: .92rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform .2s var(--ease), box-shadow .2s var(--ease), border-color .2s;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .btn-sm {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            font-size: .84rem;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--grad);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -4px rgba(124, 108, 255, .55);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 28px -4px rgba(124, 108, 255, .7);
        }

        .btn-ghost {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .btn-ghost:hover {
            background: var(--surface-2);
            border-color: var(--border-strong);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .btn-success {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -4px rgba(16, 185, 129, .5);
        }

        .btn-success:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 28px -4px rgba(16, 185, 129, .65);
        }

        .menu-btn {
            display: none;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text);
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 6px;
        }

        .menu-btn svg {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
        }

        .mobile-menu {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 72px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: var(--bg-2);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 24px;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
            z-index: 99;
        }

        .mobile-menu.open {
            display: flex;
        }

        /* ========== Hero Section ========== */
        main {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .confirm-section {
            padding: 130px 0 80px;
        }

        .confirm-wrapper {
            max-width: 820px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Success Header */
        .confirm-head {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .success-badge-icon {
            width: 72px;
            height: 72px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(40, 200, 64, 0.12);
            border: 2px solid rgba(40, 200, 64, 0.35);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(40, 200, 64, 0.25);
            color: #28c840;
            animation: pulseSuccess 2.6s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes pulseSuccess {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: scale(1);
                box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(40, 200, 64, 0.25);
            }
            50% {
                transform: scale(1.06);
                box-shadow: 0 0 44px rgba(40, 200, 64, 0.45);
            }
        }

        .confirm-head h1 {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .confirm-head p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            max-width: 580px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Slip Card */
        .slip-card {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015) 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 36px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .slip-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--grad);
        }

        .slip-top {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding-bottom: 24px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .slip-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .slip-brand img {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .slip-brand-text h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .slip-brand-text span {
            font-size: .8rem;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .slip-meta {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .slip-tag {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(40, 200, 64, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(40, 200, 64, 0.3);
            color: #4ade80;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: .78rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .slip-tag::before {
            content: '';
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #4ade80;
            box-shadow: 0 0 6px #4ade80;
        }

        /* Details Bento */
        .slip-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 28px 0;
        }

        .detail-item {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 18px 20px;
            transition: border-color .2s;
        }

        .detail-item:hover {
            border-color: var(--border-strong);
        }

        .detail-item.full-width {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        .detail-label {
            display: block;
            font-size: .78rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: .08em;
            color: var(--dim);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .detail-val {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text);
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .detail-val.accent {
            color: var(--accent-2);
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
        }

        .detail-val.budget {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            color: #4ade80;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
        }

        /* Next Steps Timeline */
        .next-steps-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 22px 24px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        .next-steps-title {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: .95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--accent-2);
        }

        .timeline-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .timeline-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .timeline-num {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--surface-2);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: .75rem;
            color: var(--accent-2);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .timeline-item h5 {
            font-size: .88rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .timeline-item p {
            font-size: .78rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Action Buttons */
        .actions-wrap {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 36px;
        }

        /* ========== Footer ========== */
        footer {
            background: var(--bg-2);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 80px 0 32px;
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        .foot-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1.4fr;
            gap: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .foot-brand p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: .92rem;
            margin: 16px 0 20px;
            max-width: 320px;
        }

        .socials {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .socials a {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--muted);
            transition: color .2s, border-color .2s;
        }

        .socials a:hover {
            color: var(--text);
            border-color: var(--border-strong);
        }

        .socials svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
        }

        .foot-col h4 {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: .9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: .04em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .foot-col ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .foot-col a {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: .9rem;
            transition: color .2s;
        }

        .foot-col a:hover {
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .contact-li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: .9rem;
        }

        .contact-li svg {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            color: var(--accent);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .foot-bottom {
            padding-top: 32px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            color: var(--dim);
            font-size: .86rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .status::before {
            content: '';
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #28c840;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #28c840;
        }

        /* Animations */
        .reveal {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(20px);
            animation: fadeInReveal .8s var(--ease) forwards;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInReveal {
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: none;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links,
            .nav-cta .btn-ghost,
            .nav-cta .btn-primary {
                display: none;
            }

            .menu-btn {
                display: inline-flex;
            }

            .slip-card {
                padding: 24px 20px;
            }

            .slip-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .timeline-list {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .foot-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 36px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="bg-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="bg-glow one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="bg-glow two" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <header class="nav" id="nav">
        <div class="container nav-inner">
            <a href="/welcome.html" class="brand" id="nav-brand">
                <img src="/images/gggg.jpg" alt="Synkro logo" />
                Synkro
            </a>

            <nav aria-label="Primary">
                <ul class="nav-links">
                    <li><a href="/welcome.html" id="nav-home">Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/about.html" id="nav-about">About</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/solution.html" id="nav-solutions">Solutions</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/team.html" id="nav-team">Team</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>

            <div class="nav-cta">
                <a href="/customer1.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="nav-contact">Contact</a>
                <a href="/booking.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="nav-book">Book a call</a>
                <button class="menu-btn" id="menu-btn" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-controls="mobile-menu">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
                        <path id="menu-icon" d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobile-menu">
        <a href="/welcome.html">Home</a>
        <a href="/about.html">About</a>
        <a href="/solution.html">Solutions</a>
        <a href="/team.html">Team</a>
        <a href="/customer1.html">Contact</a>
        <a href="/booking.html" class="btn btn-primary" id="mobile-book">Book a call</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main>
        <section class="confirm-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="confirm-wrapper">
                    <!-- Header -->
                    <div class="confirm-head reveal">
                        <div class="success-badge-icon">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="36" height="36" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h1>Submission <span class="grad-text">Confirmed!</span></h1>
                        <p>Thank you, <strong style="color:var(--text);"><%= name %></strong>. Your project brief has been logged into our engineering dispatch pipeline.</p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slip Card -->
                    <div class="slip-card reveal" style="animation-delay: .1s;">
                        <div class="slip-top">
                            <div class="slip-brand">
                                <img src="/images/gggg.jpg" alt="Synkro" />
                                <div class="slip-brand-text">
                                    <h3>Synkro Consultation Slip</h3>
                                    <span>Engineering Discovery &amp; Architecture</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="slip-meta">
                                <span class="slip-tag">Verified Intake</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Data Bento -->
                        <div class="slip-grid">
                            <div class="detail-item">
                                <span class="detail-label">Client Name</span>
                                <div class="detail-val"><%= name %></div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="detail-item">
                                <span class="detail-label">Preferred Platform</span>
                                <div class="detail-val accent"><%= platform %></div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="detail-item full-width">
                                <span class="detail-label">Project Vision / Idea</span>
                                <div class="detail-val" style="font-weight:400; line-height:1.6;"><%= idea %></div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="detail-item">
                                <span class="detail-label">Estimated Budget</span>
                                <div class="detail-val budget">₹<%= budget %></div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="detail-item">
                                <span class="detail-label">Status</span>
                                <div class="detail-val" style="color:var(--accent-2); font-size:.95rem;">Assigned to Lead Architect</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Next Steps Box -->
                        <div class="next-steps-box">
                            <h4 class="next-steps-title">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                                    <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14" />
                                </svg>
                                What Happens Next?
                            </h4>
                            <ul class="timeline-list">
                                <li class="timeline-item">
                                    <span class="timeline-num">1</span>
                                    <h5>Slip Generated</h5>
                                    <p>Download your official PDF slip below for record-keeping and reference.</p>
                                </li>
                                <li class="timeline-item">
                                    <span class="timeline-num">2</span>
                                    <h5>Founder Review</h5>
                                    <p>Our team analyzes stack requirements and scopes preliminary roadmaps.</p>
                                </li>
                                <li class="timeline-item">
                                    <span class="timeline-num">3</span>
                                    <h5>Meeting Invite</h5>
                                    <p>You'll receive a calendar invite with the <%= platform %> link within 24 hours.</p>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Action Buttons -->
                        <div class="actions-wrap">
                            <a href="/download-slip?name=<%= encodeURIComponent(name) %>&platform=<%= encodeURIComponent(platform) %>&idea=<%= encodeURIComponent(idea) %>&budget=<%= encodeURIComponent(budget) %>"
                                class="btn btn-primary" id="download-slip-btn">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4" />
                                    <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10" />
                                    <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3" />
                                </svg>
                                Download Official Slip (PDF)
                            </a>
                            <a href="/welcome.html" class="btn btn-ghost" id="return-home-btn">
                                Back to Home
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
